    "xp_challenges": "Challenges carry xp_reward 5 and xp_reward_session 20, but per D24 the proposed default awards only the session XP, once (gamification/xp-config.json#/challenge_session).",
    "xp": "No XP per attempt. Mastery XP comes from unit_mastered / lesson_mastered / mastery_test_passed (gamification/xp-config.json). This avoids double counting with xp.award idempotency.",
